<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bg">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>{{title}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{description}}">
  <meta name="author" content="Иван Давидов">
{{{head}}}
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{canonical}}">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="{{canonical}}">
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{title}}">
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{description}}">
  <meta property="og:image" content="{{siteUrl}}images/social-preview.png">
  <meta property="og:locale" content="bg_BG">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="НВО и ДЗИ – Иван Давидов">
  <script type="module" src="../../js/pages/balove-hub.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
{{{header}}}

  <main id="main" class="container page balove-hub">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Път">
      <ol>
        <li><a href="../../">Начало</a></li>
        <li><a href="../">НВО след 7 клас</a></li>
        <li><span aria-current="page">Балове</span></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="page-head__eyebrow">{{#icon}}target{{/icon}} Прием след 7 клас · {{cityCount}} града</p>
      <h1 class="page-head__title">Минимални и максимални балове по паралелки след 7 клас</h1>
      <p class="page-head__lead">Изберете град, за да видите минималните и максималните балове по паралелки за прием след 7 клас — с таблици и графики по отделните класирания.</p>
      <div class="page-head__actions cluster">
        <div class="input-icon balove-hub__search">
          {{#icon}}search{{/icon}}
          <input class="input" type="search" id="city-search" placeholder="Намери град…" aria-label="Намери град">
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="../../blog/kak-da-chetem-balovete/">{{#icon}}news{{/icon}} Как да четем баловете</a>
        {{{exportMenu}}}
      </div>
    </header>

{{#tiers}}
    <section class="section balove-hub__tier" data-tier>
      <h2 class="city-switch__label">{{label}}</h2>
      <ul class="grid-auto balove-hub__grid" role="list">
{{#cities}}
        <li data-name="{{name}}">
          <a class="card card-link balove-city{{#big}} balove-city--big{{/big}}" href="./{{slug}}/">
            <span class="balove-city__name">{{name}}</span>
            <span class="balove-city__meta">{{schools}} {{schoolsLabel}} · {{profiles}} {{profilesLabel}}</span>
            <span class="balove-city__years">{{years}}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
{{/cities}}
      </ul>
    </section>
{{/tiers}}
    <p class="muted mt-6" id="city-empty" hidden>Няма град с такова име.</p>
  </main>

{{{footer}}}
</body>
</html>
